From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:46:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] docs: describe the deployment workflow and the
 phase-driven reconciler

Record in the changelog what the workflow runtime, the deployment
package and the reconciler now do, including the breaking changes, and
bring the README, the module mapping (33 control-plane modules, 25
control-plane test files, the run snapshot contract, LocalWorkflowRuntime,
which providers can run the deployment workflow and where its store
lives) and the workflow-reference README in line with the code. The
dedup module now names the deployment run key next to the allocation
key.

The application still wires no workflow runtime or launcher, so the
documented defaults (WorkflowRuntimeUnavailable before any allocation,
one database file) are unchanged.
